*> PLB-C044 varying-control-changed: a statement in a PERFORM VARYING
*> loop changes the loop's control item.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. VARYING.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  IX                  PIC 9(3).
01  JX                  PIC 9(3).
01  TOTAL               PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01  LINES-TABLE.
    05  LINE-ENTRY      PIC X(10) OCCURS 20.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    PERFORM VARYING IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX > 20
        IF LINE-ENTRY(IX) = SPACES
            ADD 1 TO IX
        END-IF
        ADD IX TO TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM ADD-LINE VARYING JX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL JX > 20
    PERFORM VARYING IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX > 20
        ADD 1 TO IX GIVING JX
        DISPLAY LINE-ENTRY(JX)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX > 4
              AFTER JX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL JX > 5
        IF LINE-ENTRY(IX) = SPACES
            MOVE 5 TO JX
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY TOTAL
    STOP RUN.
ADD-LINE.
    IF LINE-ENTRY(JX) = "END"
        MOVE 20 TO JX
    END-IF.
